  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core contribution to support HD&#x2019;s mission to prevent, mitigate and resolve conflict globally through mediation and dialogue. HD&#x2019;s ultimate objective is to build sustainable and inclusive peace and thus help the victims of war. The organisation works across 60+ contexts, and encompasses themes such as environmental and climate-focused peace-making, and gender-inclusive mediation.  In 2024, HD generated 74 peace-making results, including at least 28 final peace-making results, 16 local-level conflict management agreements, and 12 agreements on violence reduction or humanitarian access.</narrative>
